@startuml Patient Cancellation and Rebooking
title Patient Cancellation and Rebooking
note top
Summary: Shows an owned patient cancellation and the separate rebooking flow.
end note

actor Patient
participant "Booking App" as App
participant "Auth and Access" as Auth
participant "Shared Scheduling Service" as Schedule
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Patient -> App: Cancel from My appointments
App -> Auth: Check patient session and appointment ownership
Auth -> Schedule: Authorize patient self-cancellation
Schedule -> DB: Lock doctor, cancel, release or block time, audit atomically
DB --> Schedule: Cancellation committed
Schedule --> App: Cancelled appointment and saved reason
App --> Patient: Show cancelled status when patient initiated

opt Patient chooses to book again
    Patient -> App: Start a separate booking
    App -> Schedule: Recheck current availability and policy
    Schedule --> App: Current availability and policy result
    App --> Patient: Show available dates and slots
end
note over Patient, Schedule: A suggested time does not reserve a slot. Patient cancellation and rebooking are separate.
@enduml
